WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:04.129
-Cute dog.
-You have a nice dog as well.

00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:06.507
Angie, down.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.675
Bruno, down.

00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:11.136 position:56%
Down. All the way down. Bruno, down.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.679
Have a nice day, sir.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:19.311
[man] Charlie!

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.438
Stop with the Charlie [bleep].
His name's Bruno.

00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:23.106 position:64%
He even looks like a Charlie. I love him.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.483
-It's Bruno.
-Charlie.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.026
Hey, hey, don't touch my...

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.320
♪ La, la, la, la&nbsp;♪

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.197
-...dog.
-Sorry, I didn't mean to.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.158
-He's just so cute.
-Bruno. Roll over.

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:35.369
You should take my number.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.871 position:59%
What is your daily routine with Bruno?

00:00:37.955 --> 00:00:41.333 position:63%
[Malcolm] I brush his teeth, I make sure
his pearly whites are shiny,

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:42.918 position:61%
make sure his breath is nice and fresh.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:45.170 position:66%
I would love to be a part of that routine.

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:46.380
[Lulu moans] Malcolm.

00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:50.968
Whoa! You almost hit Bruno
with that thing!

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:53.971
Well, maybe Bruno shouldn't take up
so much space on the sidewalk!

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:56.056 position:56%
You know the rules. No dogs allowed.

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:58.433
Hello. Hi, sweetheart.

00:00:58.684 --> 00:00:59.893
Hey, don't touch my dog.

00:00:59.977 --> 00:01:02.312
[Maureen] I ain't never seen
nobody so rude!

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:03.522
Hey, man, that's not a dog!

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:04.898
He sounds no good.

00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:06.233
A real piece of sh--.

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:08.235
Hey!

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.613 position:61%
There's some worse things on the street
than some dog caca.

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:14.783
["Il Barbiere Di Siviglia:
Una Voce Poco Fa" plays]

00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:23.333
[screaming]

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:32.426
I can't talk to you
with that dog humping your leg.

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:33.677
I don't want to anger it.

